cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset collection tooling, pipeline, or verification benchmarks in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Change Detection Due to Human Activities Using Satellite/Aerial Images: Dataset Pipeline and Verification Benchmark"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-28
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Reproducible dataset collection, automated extraction, structural pairing,
  validation, and cataloging pipeline for satellite and aerial imagery change detection
  focusing specifically on human-induced activities (urban development, building
  construction, and earthworks). Built as Part 1 (Data Pipeline) of the B.Tech Major
  Project at the Department of Computer Science and Engineering.
